=\"/media/0ea3339c9dca3ce959611dcee968cfe9df30a91c.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> is equal to ________. (rounded upto two decimal places)</div>\n<div>(Assume <em>V<sub>T</sub></em> = 0.5 V and μ<em><sub>n</sub>C<sub>ox</sub></em> = 150 μA/V<sup>2</sup>)</div></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"974.94","high":"974.94"},"solution":"<p>974.94 (973.00 - 975.00)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/a07976a51473d5dcdc78df4faa8be3a8b2df262c.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div> </div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":14,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>Consider the circuit shown in the figure below:</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/25825529887d78ae68c2bec651c60cb16aa0f802.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Assume op-amp to be ideal, then the value of output voltage is [Take <em>V</em><sub>1</sub> = 5 V]</div>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> 7.5 V</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> 10 V</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> 20 V</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> Insufficient data</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(a)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/0234419e4e7abbe8575fc5e16ce468e40ae903bf.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div> </div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":15,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>Consider the circuit shown in the figure below:</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/f67579a63360e8d7ececc35dd44413599fe9950e.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>The transistors <em>M</em><sub>1</sub> and <em>M</em><sub>2</sub> are in saturation, have threshold voltage <em>V<sub>T</sub></em> = 1 V, and the process transcondutance parameter <img src=\"/media/5c1369baf13bd1b0fe4851c5ab51c13a6c401583.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div>If <img src=\"/media/b3fed7b4e7a5b7e59dc2aa29304dbd8487ff583c.png\" align=\"abs